  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Road Rehabilitation Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Moldova - Road Rehabilitation Project: The project will rehabilitate 93 km of the M2 and R9 roads between Sarateni to a major junction north of the city of Soroca. The road works will also include small community infrastructure improvements in towns and villages along the road, as well as a feasibility study, environmental and social impact assessment, detailed design, and resettlement action plan.</narrative>
  </description>
